{
  "additional_concerns": [
    "The formula delegates exposure measurement and designation assessment to supplied facts. It does not implement the designation factors or asset definitions; these omissions do not alone establish a defect in this narrowly scoped classification formula.",
    "Footnote 7 locates the holistic designation assessment below 50% of NAV. The representation does not state that qualification, although an operative designation can independently establish classification and exposure at or above 50% already triggers classification.",
    "No unsupported numerical threshold, additional exclusion or permission appears in the formula. Its conflict-blocking policy is an operational evidence rule, not a requirement stated by the circular.",
    "A false result requires established false inputs for both classification routes. The question's phrase 'neither ... is established' must not be interpreted as allowing missing evidence to produce FALSE.",
    "The supplied missing dependency IDs have no authority titles or other mappings. They cannot reliably be assigned to particular incorporated authorities."
  ],
